ADDITIONAL NOTES FOR CANNABIS INDUSTRY USERS

This Software is designed to assist cannabis facilities subject to EU GMP
regulations. Users must understand:

1. This Software is a documentation assistance tool only
2. All generated content requires professional review
3. Regulatory compliance is your responsibility
4. Regular training and competency assessments are required per EU GMP
5. Documentation must be approved by qualified personnel
6. Records of all changes and approvals must be maintained
7. Regular audits and updates of SOPs are required

For EU GMP compliance guidance, refer to:
- ICH Guidelines for Good Manufacturing Practice
- EMA Guidance on GMP
- Applicable national regulations in your jurisdiction
